{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0283_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7e6b9bd9167c0c75c893b0359b5d35be75ca986d7731343dd29f8904d4eacbcf", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。\nそろそろジュリアの着替えも終わるかな？）", "zh": "（今天是写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄日。\n茱莉亚差不多也该换好衣服了吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0283_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "f576bb0ee7124edc165b4a7b798f4a5de4b59afe19581cdd3532b0b2ba0b214b", "ja": "お待たせ、{$P$}。\nええっと、その、なんだ……。", "zh": "让你久等了，{$P$}。\n那个……该怎么说呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0283_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7a470f25b412174e927ac4fc95ae5d6d193e3a21142455e4acb2fabc581cc972", "ja": "お疲れさま、ジュリア。\nうん、良く似合ってるじゃないか！　可愛いよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，茱莉亚。\n嗯，真的很适合你嘛！很可爱哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0283_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "5e959b5f7750464516ea2624d23daa29688b17bff66b0804195392abb0896e95", "ja": "だああっ、言うと思った！　褒めてくれるのは\nいいけど、もうちょっと手加減しろって……。", "zh": "啊啊啊，我就知道你会这么说！夸我是没问题啦，但也稍微收敛一点啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0283_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bfed61bfda87b31cd374297291bf480c59945ac706664ec4463108501c04d4f8", "ja": "え？　でも……本当に似合ってるし。ロックな\nジュリアもいいけど、やっぱり可愛いのも……。", "zh": "诶？可是……真的很适合你啊。虽然摇滚风的茱莉亚也不错，但果然还是可爱风的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0283_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "3cb4b66e387a3fe8c2167245b4f49d2e0a97792cf39c5f34985a36e0eefdc510", "ja": "わかった、わかったから！　ったく……。\n油断も隙もないな。", "zh": "知道了，我知道了啦！真是的……\n真是一点大意不得啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0283_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "2097171f0172bccc8046ed424422de452c4345bdcf4ff67d9810df1bd3f9e5f6", "ja": "でも、ま、ちょっと安心はできたよ。\n正直、さすがに柄じゃないだろ、って思ってたけど。", "zh": "不过嘛，能稍微放心一点了。\n说实话，我还想着“这果然不适合你吧”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0283_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "d8823d4c7a0a54bfdcd49d023709dd9617cca3c203610db7ed09261c9505217e", "ja": "あんたがそう言うなら、\nアイドルとしては合格ってことだろうからさ。", "zh": "既然你都这么说了，\n那作为偶像就算合格了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0283_1008_p", "source_sha256": "36c95985d77458b4e2b58450371f9b567d61944db42863a7fc98d2ea186dd00b", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ。\n撮影が始まるのが、楽しみだよ。", "zh": "啊，当然了。\n我很期待拍摄开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0283_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "981cf3624bf7f7c85133d347a5da493eb0a5a91b280ae74e55071cad0a41a0ad", "ja": "撮影な……あっ、そういや、\n小道具の枕、選んでくれって言われてなかったか？", "zh": "说到拍摄……啊，对了，我是不是还被拜托选一下道具用的枕头来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0283_1010_p", "source_sha256": "dd18e4eff147434ead90f1ea22457879f2d29df2eb867de99b84e6273c2de677", "ja": "ああ、うん。色々用意してくれたみたいだけど、\nその衣装と合わせるなら、可愛い系だろうな。", "zh": "啊，嗯。好像准备了各种各样的，不过要和那套服装搭配的话，还是可爱系的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0283_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "8b84a01e9da0fcae3f108f87df5e8938082881b797f4139e6bdadc92bb7287f1", "ja": "ならいっそ、とびっきり可愛い枕を選んだ方が\nいいかもな。やるならとことんやってやるさ！", "zh": "那干脆选个特别可爱的枕头，可能更好。  \n既然要做，就彻底做到最好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0283_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "60e37da7b6823d0465c6245b84f3127ec466de4892b5aa71092125294d2daf6f", "ja": "ピンクのヤツとか、ひらひらのついた奴とか……\nでも、ただ可愛いだけだと、パンチが足りないか？", "zh": "粉色的那种，或者带着飘带的那种……  \n不过，要是只有可爱，冲击力是不是不太够？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0283_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2bcdb39e9e9958b305999ea5f323f21658a45e414bef45ec4377971881575e00", "ja": "パンチか……。じゃあ、もうちょっと攻めて、\nあの『ふわモコくまさん枕』なんてどうだ？", "zh": "冲击力啊……那就再大胆一点，试试那个“毛绒绒熊熊枕头”怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0283_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "38cb6494fa30419eda5152a7bbf90fdfac3abb13af47a0eed94895c24fd9ec26", "ja": "はぁ！？　本気かよ……！\nい、いや、わかった。自分で言ったことだしな。", "zh": "哈！？你是认真的吗……！\n没、没事，我知道了。毕竟是我自己说的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0283_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "171e18b0a85ed2a431f425bd9545678d8f807aca8dfed8bbeba0b660f9d6291b", "ja": "このパジャマと合わせて、\n最高の一枚にしてやるから……見てろよな！", "zh": "我会把它和这套睡衣搭配起来，拍成最棒的一张……你就等着看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0283_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7df9be3ed5338fc9ce71e4417fd089ec4a1022757359afce3ceda7587c89272b", "ja": "（ヤケクソというか、吹っ切れたと言うか……かなり\n可愛い写真が撮れた。これは話題になりそうだ！）", "zh": "（与其说是自暴自弃，不如说是彻底放开了……拍出了一张相当可爱的照片。感觉会引起话题！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
